Jude is male [[Bestiary/Realmtouched#Aasimar|Aasimar]] in his mid-20s, with tanned skin and a very faint halo that hangs above his shaved head.

A lower ranking guardian angel proselytizer for the [[Org/Althane/Church of the Thirteenth Realm|Church of the Thirteenth Realm]]. While he is proficient in wielding the 13th realm's strange magic, he also carries a [[Phenomena/Althane/Guns|firearm]].
